usb: sprd: log the PHY hand-off (bring-up instrumentation)

ml11 (2026-10-29): the PHY probed five times, never said "registered", and the glue kept waiting. Both sides now
say what they got.

--- a/drivers/usb/phy/phy-sprd-ums9632.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/phy/phy-sprd-ums9632.c
@@ -313,7 +313,9 @@
 
 	platform_set_drvdata(pdev, p);
 
+	dev_info(dev, "usb_add_phy_dev...\n");
 	ret = usb_add_phy_dev(&p->phy);
+	dev_info(dev, "usb_add_phy_dev: %d\n", ret);
 	if (ret)
 		return dev_err_probe(dev, ret, "cannot add the usb_phy\n");
 
--- a/drivers/usb/musb/musb_sprd.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/musb/musb_sprd.c
